What is a Pre-Trained Model Category?

A Category is a group of pre-trained models that perform a similar type of task.

Think of it like this:

Vehicles
├── Car
├── Bike
└── Bus

Here, Vehicles is the category.

Similarly,

Pre-Trained Models
├── Image Classification
├── Object Detection
├── Face Recognition
└── Text/NLP

Here, Image Classification, Object Detection, Face Recognition, and NLP are categories.
===========

Pre-Trained Model Categories
----------------------------

| Category             | Purpose                          | Models                       |
| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |
| Image Classification | Identify what is in an image     | VGG16, ResNet50, InceptionV3 |
| Object Detection     | Find and locate objects          | YOLO, SSD, Faster R-CNN      |
| Face Recognition     | Identify or verify faces         | FaceNet, DeepFace, ArcFace   |
| Image Segmentation   | Identify exact object boundaries | Mask R-CNN, DeepLabV3, U-Net |
| Text / NLP           | Understand and generate text     | BERT, GPT, T5                |
| Speech Recognition   | Convert speech to text           | Whisper, DeepSpeech          |
| Image Generation     | Create images using AI           | DALL·E, GAN, StyleGAN        |


=============


